      "cooked": "<p>I was recounting the cards in my decks to be sure I wasn't missing anything.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Unfortunately, I am missing a single card from Haka's deck...everything else has all their cards and Haka's deck has only been touched once, so I am not sure if I was missing it to begin with or somehow lost a card in the one game it was played. Either way, I need to determine which card is missing.<br><br>Current Card Count (not including the Hero Card)<br>Dominion x3</p><p>Elbow Smash x3</p><p>Enduring Intercession x2</p><p>Ground Pound x2</p><p>Haka of Battle x3</p><p>Haka of Restoration x3</p><p>Haka of Shielding x3</p><p>Mere x3</p><p>Punish the Weak x3</p><p>Rampage x3</p><p>Savage Mana x2</p><p>Ta Mako x3</p><p>Taiaha x3</p><p>Vitality Surge x3</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Total: 39 cards</p>",
